{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04744","headline":"奉和圣制幸凤汤泉应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制幸凤汤泉应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"周狩闻岐礼，秦都辨雍名。\n献禽天子孝，存老圣皇情。\n温润宜冬幸，游畋乐岁成。\n汤云出水殿，暖气入山营。\n坎意无私洁，乾心称物平。\n帝歌流乐府，溪谷也增荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04744.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04744","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}